More DIRECTV Perks for Your Holiday Viewing &nbsp;&nbsp;

MyEntertainment also includes unlimited hours of cloud DVR storage, allowing customers to record live programming and watch it whenever they like.

Between four included streaming platforms, more than 60 live channels and the option to add 12 movie-focused channels through MyCinema, DIRECTV is positioning MyEntertainment as an alternative to juggling multiple entertainment subscriptions. With promotional pricing available for a limited time, the package could be worth considering for viewers looking to consolidate their holiday entertainment and potentially spend less on their monthly streaming lineup. &nbsp;

These offers are available to new customers only. Terms for included apps apply and do not replace existing subscriptions, which must be managed separately. Additional terms apply. See directv.com/affiliates/genre-packs .&nbsp;&nbsp;
